#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:5 c52ef2556def420bb6e977a5f75afaaa
msgid "Marvelmind for Non-GPS navigation"
msgstr "Marvelmind 无 GPS 导航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:9 b7598226f85e420886b8eb676eb5a689
msgid ""
"This article explains how a `MarvelMind <https://marvelmind.com/>`__ system "
"can be a short-range substitute for a GPS allowing position control modes "
"like Auto and Guided. See the `user manual "
"<https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_navigation_system_manual.pdf>`__ for"
" more details on the system."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 `MarvelMind <https://marvelmind.com/>`__ 系统作为 GPS 的近距离替代品，实现 Auto 和"
" Guided 等位置控制模式。详细信息请参阅 `用户手册 "
"<https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_navigation_system_manual.pdf>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:15 5fcafe8ac4f4479e906be20bd8800175
msgid "*image courtesy of marvelmind.com*"
msgstr "*图片由 marvelmind.com 提供*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:18 af98549d4af04189a1b1c996c2befc5f
msgid "Required Hardware"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:20 ca570c00d8ce455b89cbc50d8702790f
msgid ""
"`Marvelmind Starter Set <https://marvelmind.com/product/starter-set-super-"
"mp-3d/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Marvelmind 入门套装 <https://marvelmind.com/product/starter-set-super-"
"mp-3d/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:23 e7e4a4068d094a028ac6ecade116ce36
msgid "Marvelmind Settings"
msgstr "Marvelmind 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:25 2f0378b5ec124d5684d6cb1c0fadb6fd
msgid "Ensure the Marvelmind is firmware version 7.910 (or higher)"
msgstr "确保 Marvelmind 固件版本为 7.910 或更高"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:26 54bb86d2af4d4b34abb9ff2a02473b92
msgid ""
"The height of every stationary beacon, from the ground, must be set on the "
"dashboard."
msgstr "每个固定信标距地面的高度必须在控制面板中设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:27 2b3e20e72ffb44ab9f58f1fcc7b57442
msgid ""
"The hedge should be set to output NMEA 0183 Protocol at baud rate of 115200."
msgstr "hedge 应设置为以 115200 波特率输出 NMEA 0183 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:30 cb7228ba6de947c38876faa5cef8c521
msgid "Connecting to an autopilot"
msgstr "连接飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:32 8598e5b002d549c087e46ce1d28ceaca
msgid ""
"Here is a package with tested param files for the Autopilot and Marvelmind "
"hedge: <https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_ardupilot_settings.zip> "
"Upload the param file corresponding to your version of Autopilot software "
"with  Mission Planner or QGroundControl."
msgstr ""
"此处有针对飞控和 Marvelmind hedge "
"测试过的参数文件包：<https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_ardupilot_settings.zip>，请使用"
" Mission Planner 或 QGroundControl 上传与您的飞控软件版本对应的参数文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:34 c717f0346dba4c13b4d941a9d590e1e8
msgid ""
"Set latitude and longitude of the point (X=0, Y=0) on the Marvelmind map in "
"Georeferencing settings of the modem in the dashboard"
msgstr "在控制面板调制解调器的地理参考设置中，设置 Marvelmind 地图上点（X=0，Y=0）的纬度和经度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:35 56cf1ce2029e48dc82060a2f030ad23b
msgid ""
"Refer to section 11.11 of the `user manual "
"<https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_navigation_system_manual.pdf>` to "
"setup correct north direction on the map"
msgstr ""
"参阅 `用户手册 "
"<https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_navigation_system_manual.pdf>` 第 "
"11.11 节，在地图上设置正确的北方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:38 3badc274f028413bbe566928f77d50cf
msgid "Ground Testing"
msgstr "地面测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:40 96947f0d3b2a4bd0b7e24307f12b28ed
msgid "Connect the Autopilot to a ground station"
msgstr "将飞控连接到地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:41 c2753d4e05f64fe0866bb5879e2f5243
msgid "Click on 'freeze map' on the dashboard"
msgstr "在控制面板点击「freeze map」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:42 b05bd8d94ae94c1fb9c9ecf0fca7ddf9
msgid ""
"Check that the vehicle's position is relatively stable (i.e. moving around "
"less than one meter)"
msgstr "检查飞行器位置是否相对稳定（即移动范围小于 1 米）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:43 c97ea9b8dd794e2683819a976b9bba77
msgid ""
"Walk the vehicle around between the beacons and ensure that its position on "
"the map updates correctly"
msgstr "在信标之间移动飞行器，确认其在地图上的位置正确更新"
